---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Account details</strong> — username, email address, password
      (stored only as a cryptographic hash), and your role (student, parent,
      or teacher).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Learning data</strong> — worksheet attempts, answers, and marks
      you submit or receive in the app.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Classroom links</strong> — which classrooms a student belongs to
      and parent–child links created by teachers.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not collect advertising identifiers, sell your data, or show ads.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run the service: authentication, classrooms, marking, progress.</li>
    <li>
      To send account emails: verification and password-reset links. We do not
      send marketing email.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who can see your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Teachers see the students enrolled in their own classrooms.</li>
    <li>Parents see the progress of linked children.</li>
    <li>Nobody else. There are no public profiles.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your controls</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Delete your account</strong> at any time from the
      <a href="/account">account page</a> (this website or the app). Deletion
      is immediate and removes your user record, enrollments, and submissions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Change or reset your password</strong> and manage two-factor
      authentication from the same page.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Data is kept while your account exists. When you delete your account, your
    personal data and submissions are deleted immediately; backups expire on
    their normal rotation.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    Passwords are hashed; traffic is encrypted in transit; optional TOTP
    two-factor authentication is available to all accounts.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    Student accounts are created by teachers or by students themselves.
    Parents can request deletion of a linked child's account by contacting us.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions or deletion requests:
    <a href="mailto:support@bukulatihan.app">support@bukulatihan.app</a>
  </p>
</Base>
